  (text "Bare STM32F103CBT6; no MCU module, no external boot flash. USB device application / power policy firmware is NOT supplied."
    (at 608.33 464.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "efbafb66-d15c-523f-8058-dfb60a541b2e")
  )
  (text "Power and RF allow are low by passive default. External watchdog is hardware; heartbeat policy is firmware."
    (at 608.33 469.392 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "4fed8d77-d895-5746-bcc5-2a83a607b3c8")
  )
  (text "Disable JTAG while retaining SWD before using PB3/PB4/PA15. The two Pi power outputs are on PB8/PB9."
    (at 608.33 473.964 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "d683c3f2-e347-5a54-b9ac-a6355d34bfe5")
  )
  (text "WDI: hardware buffer permits 1k pulldown without overloading PC13."
    (at 946.15 607.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "aafdf1d8-ae62-59db-ac35-ef9e5e34e098")
  )
  (text "Feed falling edges <1.6 s nominal; enter safe outputs before starting a Pi."
    (at 946.15 614.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "d72036bb-8983-5f81-9853-dcdb95f9d89b")
  )
  (text "USB is self-powered: no VBUS -> 5 V / 3.3 V power path. D+ attach only while VBUS is present."
