  (text "Assumption: SXceiver HW v1.2. BCM numbering shown; both A/B headers use the same physical pin mapping."
    (at 22.86 64.77 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "dba45ef2-068c-5f69-a448-e2579b0c8170")
  )
  (text "Signals are NOT shared between the Pis. All pass-through conductors stay local; header orientation must match stack mechanics."
    (at 22.86 69.342 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "6a51ac45-b1a1-5a52-a8b1-2fdf0bfd9935")
  )
  (text "GPIO5/reset is an intentional exception: OR with supervisor inhibit, active HIGH. MCU absent -> SDR held in reset."
