  (text "MGMT = sole master STM32. TCA9548A channels isolate duplicate device addresses; select only one sensor bank at once."
    (at 1217.93 1203.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "6731d316-2f4c-562b-a1f7-ff14e1d333ad")
  )
  (text "This is NOT an electrical connection of the two Pi I2C masters. Pis obtain central telemetry through their UART protocol."
    (at 1217.93 1208.532 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "25f27abd-634f-5472-abcb-d1bddf1066ec")
  )
  (text "SYS bus also carries INA226 0x40 and field MCP23017 0x21."
