  (text "Selected external bare panel: Newhaven NHD-2.4-240320CF-BSXV-FT (ST7789VI). No unspecified TFT module."
    (at 22.86 861.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "fd5d3c5d-1b17-5743-8ce2-cc36a567f5c8")
  )
  (text "Panel interface: 20-pin 1.0 mm FFC, Molex 52271-2069. TFT SPI is on STM32, not on the SXceiver SPI bus."
    (at 22.86 865.632 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "ed78af5c-a773-56bc-83be-3140eac3a8a7")
  )
  (text "LCD D/C is field-expander GPB6; write it before SPI transfers. Backlight uses STM32 PB0 PWM."
    (at 22.86 870.204 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6256 1.6256)) (justify left))
    (uuid "15672ebf-fe47-596e-a650-1d4c598e8e06")
  )
  (text "Backlight: 4 x 82R; calculated worst case <125mA total with 5V rail +/-5% and LED Vf >=2.8V."
    (at 35.56 1176.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "00d7a859-a40d-5c1d-af6e-d04d9d43defa")
  )
  (text "Resistive touch inputs go to TSC2046; the MCU SPI master must apply separate chip selects."
    (at 35.56 1188.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "0f506d59-0261-517d-b9ed-8ded24ca68d1")
  )
  (text "Panel power is 3.3V. 5V_AUX connects ONLY to the LED anode through the selected panel."
    (at 35.56 1201.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left))
    (uuid "b78607b6-c536-59e1-8f83-65bf8d6b76cb")
  )
  (text "SPI clock during touch conversion must respect TSC2046 timing (do not reuse the fast TFT clock blindly)."
